{"title": "Murder Hungry", "pageid": 23216, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Murder_Hungry", "categories": ["Passive features"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Generic_Death.webp\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/1/14/Generic_Death.webp/300px-Generic_Death.webp, /w/images/1/14/Generic_Death.webp 1.5x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/1/14/Generic_Death.webp/300px-Generic_Death.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/1/14/Generic_Death.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n<p><b>Murder Hungry</b> is a passive feature related to the condition <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Unstoppable_(Condition)\" title=\"Unstoppable (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/27/Unstoppable_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Unstoppable_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/2/27/Unstoppable_Condition_Icon.webp/38px-Unstoppable_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/2/27/Unstoppable_Condition_Icon.webp/50px-Unstoppable_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Unstoppable\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/27/Unstoppable_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Unstoppable_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/2/27/Unstoppable_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Unstoppable_(Condition)\" title=\"Unstoppable (Condition)\">Unstoppable</a>. Each time a creature with this feature kills another creature, they gain another charge of Unstoppable.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"> Description </span></h2>\n<p>Each time you kill a creature, gain 1 charge of Unstoppable. \n</p>\n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div>\n</div><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Condition:_Unstoppable\"> Condition: Unstoppable </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-condition\"><strong><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Unstoppable_(Condition)\" title=\"Unstoppable (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/27/Unstoppable_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Unstoppable_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/2/27/Unstoppable_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Unstoppable_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/2/27/Unstoppable_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Unstoppable_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Unstoppable\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/27/Unstoppable_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Unstoppable_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/2/27/Unstoppable_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Unstoppable_(Condition)\" title=\"Unstoppable (Condition)\">Unstoppable</a></strong>\n<div>\n<ul><li>Reduce the next damage taken by the entity to 1 and consumes one charge of Unstoppable. Unstoppable creatures cannot be moved by any external forces — mundane or magical.</li></ul>\n</div>\n </div>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"How_to_learn\"> How to learn </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<p>Used by creatures:</p><ul style=\"list-style-type: none\"><li><a href=\"/wiki/Blythe\" title=\"Blythe\">Blythe</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Cirian\" title=\"Cirian\">Cirian</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Derysia\" title=\"Derysia\">Derysia</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Eni\" title=\"Eni\">Eni</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Feona\" title=\"Feona\">Feona</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Fustian\" title=\"Fustian\">Fustian</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Glyria\" title=\"Glyria\">Glyria</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Kevo_Phogge\" title=\"Kevo Phogge\">Kevo Phogge</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/M%27alice\" title=\"M'alice\">M'alice</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Mitchia\" title=\"Mitchia\">Mitchia</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Nov_Shmoz\" title=\"Nov Shmoz\">Nov Shmoz</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Rycke\" title=\"Rycke\">Rycke</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Spaulder\" title=\"Spaulder\">Spaulder</a></li></ul>\n<p>Other ways to learn:\n</p><p>Used by members of the <a href=\"/wiki/Cult_of_Bhaal\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Cult of Bhaal\">Cult of Bhaal</a>.\n</p>\n</div>    \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260715101150\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.036 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.042 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 1052/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 7568/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 2708/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 26/200\nExpensive parser function count: 0/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 772/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 40/1000\nLua time usage: 0.003/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 643648/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   37.904      1 Template:Passive_feature_page\n100.00%   37.904      1 -total\n 47.55%   18.024      1 Template:PageSeo\n 46.42%   17.595      1 Template:Hidden_code\n 35.91%   13.611      1 Template:Cond\n 26.53%   10.055      2 Template:Icon_link\n 25.54%    9.681      2 Template:Icon_text\n 23.30%    8.832      1 Template:Condition_inline/format\n 22.10%    8.379      5 Template:Trim\n 17.72%    6.718      2 Template:Ifempty\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key bg3wiki:pcache:idhash:23216-0!canonical and timestamp 20260715101150 and revision id 201416. Rendering was triggered because: unknown\n -->\n</div>"}